Note: By [[isomorphism between linear groups over field:F2]], we obtain that all the groups <math>GL(2,2)</math>, <math>SL(2,2)</math>, <math>PGL(2,2)</math>, and <math>PSL(2,2)</math> are isomorphic to each other, and hence to <math>S_3</math>. Hence, we can also study <math>S_3</math> in terms of [[element structure of projective general linear group of degree two over a finite field]], [[element structure of special linear group of degree two over a finite field]], and [[element structure of projective special linear group of degree two over a finite field]].

